@model Fanex.AffiliateAdmin.Core.Entities.EmailTemplateInfo
<div>
    Dear @Model.FirstName,<br />
    <br />
    Congratulation on becoming our @Model.SystemName affiliate!<br />
    <br />
    To ensure for a faster payout for your affiliate, please take some time to read
    the following procedure for withdrawal:<br />
    <br />
    1. Please do register a new @Model.SystemName betting account<br />
    <br />
    2. Send an email to <a href="mailto:@Model.MailContact">@Model.MailContact</a> and
    state your @Model.SystemName username together with your affiliate username<br />
    <br />
    3. After sending email to us for your @Model.SystemName account, please login your
    affiliate account and click on "My Account", at the payment Information column,
    please change your payment method to @Model.SystemName Player Account, fill in your
    @Model.SystemName username and click submit.<br />
    <br />
    4. We will settle member's commission payout once in a month, please access your
    affiliate account and click on Payment request, enter the amount and request Payout.<br />
    <br />
    5. If your withdrawal request is approved, your fund will be automatically transferred
    to your @Model.SystemName betting account.<br />
    <br />
    6. You may request a withdrawal from your @Model.SystemName betting account anytime
    and there will be no additional charges.<br />
    <br />
    Please take note:<br />
    <br />
    1. Your @Model.SystemName betting account is for affiliate purpose only; please
    do not make any deposit or placing bet.<br />
    <br />
    2. Your @Model.SystemName betting account registered name must be the same registered
    name that you had registered in your affiliate account, and it must be your real
    name.<br />
    <br />
    3. The above procedures is for first time withdrawal affiliate members only, if
    request for 2nd or 3rd withdrawal, please refer to step 4, 5 and 6.<br />
    <br />
    Please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any further question.<br />
    <br />
    Sincerely,<br />
    <br />
    @Model.SystemName Affiliates Team<br />
    Email: <a href="mailto:@Model.MailContact">@Model.MailContact</a>
</div>